questions.question:
What is the output of the following pseudo-code?

```
function foo(n):
    if n <= 1:
        return n
    return foo(n-1) + foo(n-2)

PRINT foo(6)
```

What is the output of the following pseudo-code?

```
function mystery(n):
    if n == 0:
        return 1
    return n * mystery(n - 1)

PRINT mystery(5)
```
